orSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n2.0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\n<b>MorvDonald's Interior: 99.9997%</b><br />Factory: 0.0001%<br />Mansion: 0.0001%<br />Mineshaft: 0.0001%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n20</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n30</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 5</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nHoarding Bug, Masked</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nCurcuit Bees, Manticoil, Eyeless Dog, Forest Keeper</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n17</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n16</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n14</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#