pan> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Mrov bought McDonalds.<br />He's here\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<noscript><div role='alert' class='oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-flaggedElement-error oo-ui-iconElement oo-ui-messageWidget-block oo-ui-messageWidget'><span class='oo-ui-iconElement-icon oo-ui-icon-error oo-ui-image-error'></span><span class='oo-ui-labelElement-label'>JavaScript must be enabled for this map to work. If you do not see it below, it probably means you have JavaScript disabled.</span></div><style>.ext-datamaps-container{display:none}</style></noscript><div data-datamap-id=\"1096\" data-mw-datamaps=\"map\" data-mw-datamaps-configure=\"{&quot;id&quot;:1096,&quot;presentationFlags&quot;:0}\" class=\"ext-datamaps-container map-MorvDonalds oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout oo-ui-panelLayout-framed maps\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-top oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"></div><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-content oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-leaflet\"><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-status\"><div role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" id=\"ooui-php-1\" class=\"oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-progressBarWidget-indeterminate oo-ui-progressBarWidget\" data-ooui=\"{&quot;_&quot;:&quot;OO.ui.ProgressBarWidget&quot;,&quot;progress&quot;:false}\"><div class=\"oo-ui-progressBarWidget-bar\"></div></div><div>Loading scripts</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ext-datamaps-container-bottom oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout\"></div><script type=\"application/datamap+json\" data-purpose=\"config\">{\"version\":3642,\"lastPurgeTimestamp\":\"20260805182247\",\"cOrder\":0,\"cRot\":0,\"crs\":[[0,0],[540,960]],\"flags\":521,\"zoom\":{\"lock\":false,\"auto\":true,\"min\":0.05,\"max\":6,\"scrollSpeed\":1},\"backgrounds\":[{\"image\":\"/images/MorvDonalds_map.jpg?f907d6\"}],\"groups\":{\"Ship\":{\"name\":\"Ship\",\"size\":[100,100],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Ship_Icon.png/150px-Ship_Icon.png?1b6048\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Ship_Icon.png/24px-Ship_Icon.png?1b6048\"},\"MainEntrance\":{\"name\":\"Main Entrance\",\"size\":[100,100],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Main_entrance.png/150px-Main_entrance.png?6b87de\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Main_entrance.png/24px-Main_entrance.png?6b87de\"},\"FireExits\":{\"name\":\"Fire Exit\",\"size\":[75,75],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Fire_exit.png/112px-Fire_exit.png?17c3c4\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Fire_exit.png/24px-Fire_exit.png?17c3c4\"},\"ShipsPart\":{\"name\":\"Ship's Part\",\"size\":[50,50],\"pinColor\":\"#0094ff\"},\"Dropship\":{\"name\":\"Dropship\",\"size\":[75,75],\"markerIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Drop_Ship.png/112px-Drop_Ship.png?e99b10\",\"legendIcon\":\"/images/thumb/Drop_Ship.png/24px-Drop_Ship.png?e99b10\"},\"Crystal\":{\"name\":\"Lava crystal\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#ff6a00\",\"strokeColor\":\"#d85600\",\"strokeWidth\":3},\"MorvDonaldsBuilding\":{\"name\":\"MorvDonalds building\",\"size\":[50,50],\"pinColor\":\"#e5e5e5\"},\"DeadTree\":{\"name\":\"Dead tree\",\"size\":40,\"fillColor\":\"#8c5938\",\"strokeColor\":\"#593823\",\"strokeWidth\":3}},\"layers\":[],\"layerIds\":[]}</script></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> happy customers<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> bleak.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> oh if only you knew.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<p>MorvDonalds is a specific rocky moon featuring rough landscapes, some several plants, crystals, dead trees and MorvDonalds's building. If you played Lethal Company with Wesley's Moons before you probably noticed that moon's surface is similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Infernis\" title=\"Infernis\">Infernis</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lecaro\" title=\"Lecaro\">Lecaro</a> - two volanic like moons that you can unlock during your journey. Upon exiting the ship, when you go straight you'll see MorvDonalds's building which is similar to how Mcdonalds restaurants look. If you stop and go left instead of going to main entrance, you'll be close to one of fire exits also crystals will lead you to it. Fire exits on this moon are untypical because they don't look like they're connected to a building. It's similar to how main entrance on <a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\">Hyx</a> is presented. Another and last fire exit is located on the other half of the map. When you'll be standing in front of main entrance and then go right and straight down the path, you'll find the second fire exit.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p><b>MorvDonalds</b> supports Rainy, Foggy, Stormy, Eclipsed, Hurricane, Forsaken, Hallowed and Earthquake weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unique_Scrap\">Unique Scrap</span></h3>\n<p>This moon contains only one unique scrap item which is <b>Mrov Sauce</b>. It is the most common scrap item on this moon.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interior\">Interior</span></h3>\n<p>This moon has its own unique interior that spawn here only. It has <b>99.9997%</b> chance to spawn. <b>Interior looks like McDonald's restaurant</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p>This moon is unlocked by default.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p>This moon does not unlock any other moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<p><b>NOTE:</b> Maneater plushie, Silent package and Webley can appear only when you downloaded Wesley's Moons.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Large axle</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Large_axle.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Large axle.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/60px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Large_axle.png/90px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 1.5x, /images/thumb/Large_axle.png/120px-Large_axle.png?6b5c59 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.32%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mrov Sauce</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mrov_sauce.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Mrov sauce.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Mrov_sauce.png/60px-Mrov_sauce.png?47111c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Mrov_sauce.png/90px-Mrov_sauce.png?47111c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Mrov_sauce.png/120px-Mrov_sauce.png?47111c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>101</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>300</td>\n<td>97.4%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maneater plushie</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Maneater_plushie.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Maneater plushie.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Maneater_plushie.png/60px-Maneater_plushie.png?1cd011\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Maneater_plushie.png/90px-Maneater_plushie.png?1cd011 1.5x, /images/thumb/Maneater_plushie.png/120px-Maneater_plushie.png?1cd011 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.32%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Silent package</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Silent_package.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Silent package.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Silent_package.png/60px-Silent_package.png?b37502\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Silent_package.png/90px-Silent_package.png?b37502 1.5x, /images/thumb/Silent_package.png/120px-Silent_package.png?b37502 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>88</td>\n<td>104</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.65%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webley</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Webley.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Webley.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Webley.png/60px-Webley.png?b95fe7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"item-preview thumbborder\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Webley.png/90px-Webley.png?b95fe7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Webley.png/120px-Webley.png?b95fe7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></div></div></td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>76</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.65%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Entities\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Entities\">&gt; Entities</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Interior.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; width: 100%;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bracken</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3.85%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nutcracker</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3.85%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Barber</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>7.68%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Masked</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>23.08%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coil-head</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3.85%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hoarding Bug</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>57.68%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Exterior.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; width: 100%;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eyeless Dog</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>50%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forest Keeper</td>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>50%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Enemy_Spawns_.28Daytime_Enemies.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></h3>\n<div style=\"overflow-x: auto; width: 100%;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Enemy Name</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Max Spawned</th>\n<th>Power Lvl.</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Circuit Bees</td>\n<td>73</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>46.78%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manticoil</td>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>37.82%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaming Locust</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>15.37%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<p>This moon does not have any lore.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the only Lethal Company mod created by <b>Magic_Wesley</b> that contains custom moon and its own unique interior at the same time.</li>\n<li>This mod was created because it was Wesley's secret santa gift for his friend <b>Mrov</b>.</li>\n<li>MorvDonalds unique interior also has references to <b>Poland</b> just because <b>Mrov</b> (Wesley's friend for who this moon was made) is from Poland.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t